{"id":"cdc082007fc48de6","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-order7-scott-open-set.md","title":"ZFC Order7 Scott Open Set","display":"df-zfc-order7-scott-open-set — ZFC Order7 Scott Open Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order7-scott-open-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order7-scott-open-set"],"display":"df-zfc-order7-scott-open-set — ZFC Order7 Scott Open Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order7-scott-open-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order7-scott-open-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order7-scott-open-set — ZFC Order7 Scott Open Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"599d16bb1d9ed41c\" href=\"?note=599d16bb1d9ed41c\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,R,U,D,s\">\\(X,R,U,D,s\\)</span> (parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\)</span> (partial order, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7ScottOpenSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7ScottOpenSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order7\\text{-}scott\\text{-}open\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7ScottOpenSet}_S(X,R,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\land U\\subseteq X\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\bigl(x\\in U\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\to y\\in U\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall D\\subseteq X\\,\\forall s\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\nD\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in D\\;\\exists c\\in D\\;(\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in R)\n\\land\\forall u\\in X\\;\\bigl((\\forall d\\in D\\;\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\n\\land s\\in U\\to D\\cap U\\ne\\varnothing\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order7\\text{-}scott\\text{-}open\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7ScottOpenSet}_S(X,R,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\land U\\subseteq X\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\bigl(x\\in U\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\to y\\in U\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall D\\subseteq X\\,\\forall s\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\nD\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in D\\;\\exists c\\in D\\;(\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in R)\n\\land\\forall u\\in X\\;\\bigl((\\forall d\\in D\\;\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\n\\land s\\in U\\to D\\cap U\\ne\\varnothing\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Scott 开集必须是上集，并且不可避开任何上确界落在其中的非空有向集。</li>\n<li>原式只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 是一个上界而不是最小上界，因而比 Scott 不可达性强得多。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md","status":"resolved","id":"599d16bb1d9ed41c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R\\subseteq X\\times X$ and $\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,R)$ (partial order, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,R,U,D,s","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7ScottOpenSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order7\\text{-}scott\\text{-}open\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7ScottOpenSet}_S(X,R,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\land U\\subseteq X\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\bigl(x\\in U\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\to y\\in U\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall D\\subseteq X\\,\\forall s\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\nD\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in D\\;\\exists c\\in D\\;(\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in R)\n\\land\\forall u\\in X\\;\\bigl((\\forall d\\in D\\;\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\n\\land s\\in U\\to D\\cap U\\ne\\varnothing\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"s","display":false}],"bytes":1547,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2958","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-order7-scott-open-set.md|58-df-zfc-order7-scott-open-set]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9ee45afab4c00dd5","599d16bb1d9ed41c"]}